# Test snippets
snippet test "Test Snippet" b
This is a test snippet
endsnippet

# Book snippets
snippet book "Basic Book Template" b
Title: ${1:Book Title}
Author: ${2:Author Name}
Year: ${3:Year}
endsnippet

# Example book entries
snippet book1984 "George Orwell - 1984" b
"1984" by George Orwell (1949)
A dystopian novel set in a totalitarian regime where Big Brother is always watching.
endsnippet

snippet bookgats "F. Scott Fitzgerald - The Great Gatsby" b
"The Great Gatsby" by F. Scott Fitzgerald (1925)
A novel about the American Dream, wealth, and social class in the Jazz Age.
endsnippet

snippet bookmoby "Herman Melville - Moby Dick" b
"Moby Dick" by Herman Melville (1851)
An epic tale of Captain Ahab's quest for revenge against the white whale, Moby Dick.
endsnippet

snippet bookquix "Miguel de Cervantes - Don Quixote" b
"Don Quixote" by Miguel de Cervantes (1605)
A satirical novel about a man who becomes so enamored with tales of chivalry that he loses his sanity and sets out to revive knighthood.
endsnippet

snippet bookpot "J.K. Rowling - Harry Potter series" b
"Harry Potter" series by J.K. Rowling (1997-2007)
A fantasy series following the journey of young wizard Harry Potter and his friends.
endsnippet

snippet bookhgr "Suzanne Collins - The Hunger Games" b
"The Hunger Games" by Suzanne Collins (2008)
A dystopian novel where youth are forced to participate in a televised death match.
endsnippet

snippet booksap "Yuval Noah Harari - Sapiens" b
"Sapiens: A Brief History of Humankind" by Yuval Noah Harari (2011)
A book exploring the history and impact of Homo sapiens on the world.
endsnippet

snippet booktfs "Daniel Kahneman - Thinking, Fast and Slow" b
"Thinking, Fast and Slow" by Daniel Kahneman (2011)
An examination of the two systems that drive the way we think and make decisions.
endsnippet

# Make the file type explicit
global !p
def is_markdown(fn):
    return fn.endswith('.md')
endglobal
